e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZXsXXvhugwYQ7kNvwFYEZTh&_nc_oc=AdqMCGU1mwaPX1Hr15JtbmIr2Fdhr_UWCOv_ewUHXTue88ZX-dOGSqOwDgPz6S79i9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4O8gxM_2XdYB2h5naTxHxoO94CaXnCzS-qsTlXajEtoA&oe=6A185A79"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FpXS0cq1_AUQ7kNvwF6tyjP&_nc_oc=AdrV21uqcSwSLh1AemsVYpWCbhwvpfFQYFptwk8z2ue-zpZbf48n-TajCzgCs_JHZAg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4P3XKq9IFA2KTXn3N3JwTVeAQijZjhHiucRB-7kZO1zw&oe=6A186A13"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O6-Q9BI6IaEQ7kNvwF7bmea&_nc_oc=Adqs-DiEBxlNdZLOFWF4iiWD3VatsT7etyOy0H288x65Udy4GX2rFgm4x6YjMS9HbHc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6fga0MBv8cvf7coIfMoIGwjWhI8_WRtl96lO0yA9n2pg&oe=6A183D7B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sXPu5D1TxFoQ7kNvwEtJaM_&_nc_oc=AdqR6By0Ru1rLBEGYBDIjB7K6Wzc4lK1be7m6OPntDJmCDM56lky4kwBUoKYI23EhPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Wui27Dz_H7Hrig_tcGtHOLrtcTbf1S8Qpl7ZpGmoBSA&oe=6A183ECA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2hilPzkUi7oQ7kNvwH-pHni&_nc_oc=Adriz1PZovu21onyAcANxgyqHGn-urQTjsISkr1-ebTteb5XoHbGw6pOUG2n9Xu8Hb4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af41wMQWsariulDVUeubjplbKVOiiBsYZ37QeCDMywYHYQ&oe=6A18603E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se